2026-08-29 00:27:58 | INFO     | p2p_knowledge_hub.chunking.recursive_chunker:chunk:54 | Following chunks were produced. [DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4a793546-c227-42b3-a4a8-07482c1c8c0d'), chunk_index=1, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 161631, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='© 2025\nRutgers University Procurement Services\nPage 1 of 8\nCAUTION:  A printed copy of this document is uncontrolled and may not be the current version. Access current version on the UPS website.\nSTANDARD OPERATING PROCEDURE:\n2.0 SUPPLIER MANAGEMENT\nThis procedure is in accordance with Procurement and Payment Policy 20.1.11.\nIntroduction\nSupplier Management is a set of processes, activities, systems and information management tools that', page_no=1, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('899f4854-9cb7-4244-a02f-0147574760a3'), chunk_index=2, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 161649, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='allows Rutgers to manage and have maximum visibility into all activities associated with a supplier. UPS\nis responsible for ensuring that all suppliers engaged by the university are properly onboarded,\nmaintained, and managed in compliance with university, state, and federal requirements.\nProcedure Outline\n2.1\nNew Supplier Set Up\n2.2\nSupplier Record Maintenance\n2.3\nSupplier Ethics\n2.4\nDebarred Supplier List\n2.5\nFederal Contracting and the Small Business Contracting Plan (SBSP)\n2.6', page_no=1, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('48643dc4-857f-4b58-bb79-bf44cc90d771'), chunk_index=3, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 161656, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Sustainability\n2.7\nSupplier Management Post Contract Award\nDefinitions\nCorporation: An organization that is recognized as having a legal existence as an entity separate and\ndistinct from its owners. Corporations are owned by their stockholders (shareholders) who share in\nprofits and losses generated through the firm's operations.\nEmployer Identification Number (EIN):  A unique nine-digit number assigned by the Internal Revenue", page_no=1, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b62cb2f0-6572-4b90-a727-d4ae277ec3bd'), chunk_index=4, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 161660, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Service (IRS) to business entities operating in the United States for the purposes of identification.  The\nEIN is also known as the Federal Tax Identification Number.\nIndependent Contractor or Employee Determination Form (ICED): This is a prerequisite document for\nguest lecturer, honorarium, or professional services engagements, that the prospective supplier must\ncomplete and must be reviewed and approved by UPS or University Tax Department prior to any start of\nservice.', page_no=1, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4978fd0e-7cda-4fa1-a145-7d1b2b899331'), chunk_index=5, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 161665, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Individual Tax Identification Number (ITIN): A tax processing number only available for certain non-\nresident and resident aliens, their spouses, and dependents who cannot get a Social Security Number\n(SSN).  It is a 9-digit number, beginning with the number "9", formatted like an SSN (NNN-NN-NN).\nLimited Liability Company (LLC): A organization whereby the members of the company cannot be held', page_no=1, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a7795e54-a3cb-44d3-a828-8b466e650049'), chunk_index=6, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 161671, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="personally liable for the company's debts or liabilities. This is a hybrid entity that combines the\ncharacteristics of a corporation and a partnership or sole proprietorship.", page_no=1, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('13319abe-ed7d-48a0-b03f-2ecb5d9759ab'), chunk_index=7, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 161780, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='© 2025\nRutgers University Procurement Services\nPage 2 of 8\nCAUTION:  A printed copy of this document is uncontrolled and may not be the current version. Access current version on the UPS website.\nOwnership Declaration Form: A form required to be submitted by all suppliers performing work with\nRBHS or other Rutgers units that may be Medicare reimbursable.', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('eb43a80c-00d2-4357-909c-b8add2145aea'), chunk_index=8, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 161786, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Partnership: An organization in which two or more individuals pool money, skills, and other resources,\nand share profit and loss in accordance with terms of the partnership agreement.\nPaymentWorks: Self-service supplier data portal for new supplier onboarding and existing supplier\nmaintenance.\nProcurement Approver:  Approver within UPS who will perform a general screen and review of\ninvitation requests for a new Supplier or review any updates of a current supplier.', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1c819612-84de-4533-93ad-10f32d1f53e8'), chunk_index=9, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 161790, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='RU Marketplace: The university online system that covers all stages of the procurement-to-payment\nprocess. This system provides a comprehensive approach to the provider and end user. The tool also\nallows for data analytics by measuring the effectiveness of contracts, transaction approval cycle times,\nand use of automated invoice processing.\nSocial Security Number (SSN): A unique 9-digit number in the format 000-00-0000 issued to individuals', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4d980578-4179-4d78-b595-dc26266fa7f0'), chunk_index=10, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 161794, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='in the United States to track Social Security benefits and for other identification purposes.\nSole Proprietor: A business that legally has no separate existence from its owner.  A sole proprietorship\nis the simplest business form under which one can operate a business. The sole proprietorship is not a\nlegal entity. It simply refers to a person who owns the business and is personally responsible for its\ndebts.', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9c6a7ad1-ab0b-4052-81cf-00d55a5d974a'), chunk_index=11, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 161800, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Standard Operational Procedure (SOP): A set of instructions that functionally describes the key\nprocedures.\nSupplier: Any individual, company, corporation, partnership or sole proprietor that provides goods or\nservices to the University.\nTax Identification Number (TIN): An identification number used by the Internal Revenue Service (IRS) in\nthe administration of tax laws.  The TIN is also known as the Employer Identification Number (EIN).\nUnit: A Rutgers internal department.', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('cdeabd68-87a0-46b5-9972-2b79c3fdb438'), chunk_index=12, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 161804, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='University Procurement Services (UPS): The unit that processes all procurement transactions including\nrequisitions and invoices, facilitates the formal bid process, and negotiates and manages contracts.\nW-8 Form - The IRS form that certifies foreign status and needs to be completed for any foreign individual\n(W-8BEN) or company (W-8BEN-E) when the University is making a payment to them. It is also used to', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f9027242-297b-4415-886d-3ecd38df6a0c'), chunk_index=13, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 161808, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='validate a tax treaty exemption from, or a reduced rate of, withholding on certain income.\nW-9 Form -The IRS form which certifies a domestic taxpayers identification number.  This form is\nrequested from suppliers to conform to IRS regulations.  Rutgers must have a federal tax identification', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('758448dc-1e64-4a15-975a-6d3250dff04b'), chunk_index=14, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 161916, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='© 2025\nRutgers University Procurement Services\nPage 3 of 8\nCAUTION:  A printed copy of this document is uncontrolled and may not be the current version. Access current version on the UPS website.\nnumber or social security number on file for all suppliers and individuals receiving payments from the\nUniversity and this form is used to certify those numbers.\nProcedures\n2.1 New Supplier Set-Up Process\nOverview', page_no=3, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('25accbfe-1afe-4737-83e4-98d236cab65a'), chunk_index=15, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 161920, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Prior to purchasing a good or a service, units should first research and attempt to use contracted\nsuppliers and suppliers already in RU Marketplace to meet their needs, before seeking to enter an\nadditional supplier to the system.  If no existing suppliers can provide the good or service, a new\nsupplier must be invited through PaymentWorks, and approved by UPS.', page_no=3, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1bcfd345-5669-4196-8693-2b645e6fe64f'), chunk_index=16, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 161925, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Any supplier seeking to do business with or receive payment from the University must first be\nestablished in PaymentWorks.\nPaymentWorks is the University’s supplier onboarding and management platform.  It enables units to\ninvite new or existing (“legacy”) suppliers who have not yet completed the onboarding process. The\nsystem securely collects and validates supplier information while providing visibility into the onboarding', page_no=3, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c0086604-a3b0-407d-a30a-dba5ab72402b'), chunk_index=17, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 161928, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='workflow. Once registered in PaymentWorks, suppliers can maintain their own profile, including\naddress, tax, and contact information, directly within the platform.\nInviting A Supplier to Register\nBefore sending an invitation, units should:\n1. Confirm that no existing supplier can provide the required good or service.\n2. Search in PaymentWorks to ensure the supplier is not already registered.\nImportant Notes:\n•', page_no=3, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('29d29a9f-0e56-49f3-9fd5-cf3bfd39ca7e'), chunk_index=18, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 161932, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='New suppliers for promotional merchandise, apparel, signage, displays, or awards should\nnot be invited or added without prior approval from the Office of Trademark Licensing\n(trademark@ucm.rutgers.edu) within University Communications & Marketing.\n•\nSuppliers performing architectural, engineering, or trade-related work (e.g., electrical,\npainting, HVAC, plumbing) should not be invited. These requests are managed exclusively\nthrough Institutional Planning & Operations (IP&O).\n•', page_no=3, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9cff50f4-82c5-4ba7-a461-e4598275ca95'), chunk_index=19, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 161936, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Non-PO transactions that do not involve the purchase of goods or services are not required\nto register in PaymentWorks.\n•\nThe following types of payments should be processed through Candex:\no\nHonoraria\no\nTravel – Non-Employee\no\nAthletics – Game Day Services\no\nPatient Actors\no\nNet (Print) Royalties', page_no=3, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4379bbf5-a64d-41f3-b1db-46c91e47ec1e'), chunk_index=20, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162032, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='© 2025\nRutgers University Procurement Services\nPage 4 of 8\nCAUTION:  A printed copy of this document is uncontrolled and may not be the current version. Access current version on the UPS website.\nTo invite a supplier, the unit — referred to as the “initiator” — must complete the supplier\ninvitation form, which includes the following information (see PaymentWorks Training Videos\nfor instructions):\n•\nSupplier name\n•', page_no=4, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a78e5675-113b-432c-b9de-598e71ad0403'), chunk_index=21, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162038, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='A valid supplier email address\n•\nGood or service provided\n•\nSelection of company or individual\n•\nPersonalized message (optional) – for the supplier\n•\nPO or check request supplier\nOnce submitted, the invitation is routed to UPS for review and approval .\nCriteria for supplier invitation approval\nUPS will approve supplier invitations based on the following criteria:\na) The supplier is not already registered in PaymentWorks.', page_no=4, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('939fab23-2de7-4c3b-b49c-20491b665502'), chunk_index=22, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162042, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='b) The supplier provides a good or service that cannot be sourced from an existing University-\nContracted Supplier.\nc) The supplier is not a current Rutgers student.\nd) The supplier is not a current or recently separated employee\na. A 6-month gap is required following their last paycheck with Rutgers.\nb. The hire date must be a different calendar year.', page_no=4, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7841931f-3d3e-4de1-b4de-93b2644a8055'), chunk_index=23, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162046, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='c. The new role cannot be the same job performed prior to leaving the university.\ne) The supplier does not qualify for a Non-PO Upload transaction.\nSupplier Registration Process\nOnce an invitation is approved by UPS, the potential supplier will receive an email with instructions to\ncreate an account. After creating their account, they will receive a follow-up email to begin their New', page_no=4, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e5fd5b52-ec8a-429d-acc7-75949f9ee4d0'), chunk_index=24, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162050, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Vendor Registration Form.   Suppliers are required to submit the following documentation in order to\nformally register with PaymentWorks:\n•\nName as it appears on the W-9 (or W-8 if foreign)\n•\nNote: W-9 must be signed and dated within the last 18 months; W-8 must be signed and dated\nwithin the last three years.\n•\nAddress\n•\nEmail address\n•\nTax ID/SSN number\n•\nPhone number\n•', page_no=4, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('84e33fe5-8a02-4b11-8612-c2ddb35f0ab5'), chunk_index=25, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162054, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Signed W-9 (US entity) or W-8 (foreign entity)\nAny missing information will result in a supplier registration being returned to the supplier for\ncorrection and resubmission. It is the Supplier’s responsibility to complete the registration in full and\nsubmit all required documentation.  Incomplete registrations will delay the onboarding process.', page_no=4, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('25784a19-4758-4468-bd41-4f507d9793cd'), chunk_index=26, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162146, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='© 2025\nRutgers University Procurement Services\nPage 5 of 8\nCAUTION:  A printed copy of this document is uncontrolled and may not be the current version. Access current version on the UPS website.\nNew Supplier Screening and Entry\nOnce the potential supplier submits their completed registration, PaymentWorks conducts a general\nscreening to include:\n•\nConfirm the validity of the tax identification number\n•', page_no=5, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9f6068ba-83db-4741-afa5-cd13159bb144'), chunk_index=27, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162150, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Confirm that the supplier is not on the debarred supplier list (See SAM.gov)\n•\nConfirm supplier’s address is valid\n•\nConfirm the supplier record does not already exists in our supplier database\nOnce the PaymentWorks screening is complete, UPS will also conduct an additional screening that\nincludes:\n•\nConfirming the supplier is not a current employee or student of Rutgers\n•\nAddressing any issues identified during the PaymentWorks screening.', page_no=5, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9675e766-2eb7-4958-a8f2-ce5f9bb61d33'), chunk_index=28, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162156, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Once this process is complete and no issues are discovered, the registration will be approved, and the\nsupplier record will be added to Oracle and RU Marketplace.  Both the invitation initiator and the\nsupplier will receive email notification that the supplier has been established.\nUnits can verify for supplier set-up by entering the supplier name or supplier number in any requisition', page_no=5, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('412ba7c0-081c-484d-889b-296f47337df0'), chunk_index=29, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162160, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='form in RU Marketplace.  Units must still follow the sourcing process (See 3.0 Sourcing) to complete the\npurchase.\nIf an issue is discovered, employees/students, or a supplier appears on the debarred list, a member of\nthe UPS will contact the supplier and invitation initiator.\n2.2 Supplier Record Maintenance\nFrom time to time, updates to a supplier record will be required.  For all suppliers not onboarded in', page_no=5, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0980cf07-9476-4098-b512-e426fdab7303'), chunk_index=30, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162166, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='PaymentWorks, units should invite that supplier via a PaymentWorks invitation (see 2.1 New Supplier\nRequest Process) so that the supplier goes through a sanctions check.  The old record will be de-\nactivated once the registration has been approved and entered.  Any updates to a supplier’s information\ngoing forward should be made by the supplier directly via PaymentWorks.\nTypical changes include:\n• New address', page_no=5, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('709639a6-53b9-4975-868c-6abb1936b7cf'), chunk_index=31, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162169, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='• Changes to an existing address or contact information\n• Change in name\n• De-activation due to going out of business or purchase by another company\n• Tax identification change\n•\nNote: A change in tax identification requires issuing a new PaymentWorks invitation and\na Procurement Help Desk ticket request to inactivate the existing supplier record.', page_no=5, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b1b34328-ad76-4e47-9263-d9a6cb9946e8'), chunk_index=32, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162268, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='© 2025\nRutgers University Procurement Services\nPage 6 of 8\nCAUTION:  A printed copy of this document is uncontrolled and may not be the current version. Access current version on the UPS website.\nFor suppliers already in the system but who require a change, they will submit the change in the\nPaymentWorks portal directly.   The change request will be reviewed and either approved or rejected.', page_no=6, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('97f72a27-c3ed-442a-b91d-26e3a8956aa3'), chunk_index=33, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162272, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The Supplier Maintenance team also performs other regular maintenance activities.  Annually, the team\nwill deactivate suppliers who have not had activity for at least 24 months.  If a supplier needs to be\nreactivated, the unit can submit a Help Desk ticket. Any reactivation would require the supplier to be\nregistered in PaymentWorks.\n2.3 Supplier Ethics\nCurrent and prospective suppliers are prohibited from giving money, loans, credits, entertainment,', page_no=6, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('32318a9c-6b4c-4409-b821-13454c25eeaf'), chunk_index=34, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162277, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='favors, services or gifts to Rutgers employees.  Such gifts and gratuities, even if of seemingly low value,\ncan give rise to a conflict of interest or the appearance of a conflict of interest.  Such gifts will be\npromptly disposed of.  If it is deemed necessary to visit a supplier site for a demonstration, the\nuniversity pays all related expenses.  Please see Rutgers policy 40.2.12 - Gratuities, Guests, Gifts and Use', page_no=6, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('508586d8-0273-4463-bddb-4915046a2e85'), chunk_index=35, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162281, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='of University Resources.\n2.4 Debarred Supplier List\nRutgers University complies with Federal regulations that prohibit transacting or making payments to\nsuppliers that are debarred or appear on a prohibited list maintained by the U.S. Federal Contractor\nRegistration, or other federal agency.  This applies to all procurement and disbursement transactions\nincluding but not limited to suppliers, individuals, external / independent contractors or consultants,', page_no=6, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('07fc3739-8fa1-41a2-bdcb-bfba95def521'), chunk_index=36, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162285, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='professional services providers, entertainers, performers, one-time lecture fees and construction related\ngoods and services.\nUPS is responsible for confirming that suppliers are not on the debarred list.  No contract, agreement,\npurchase order, or payment by Rutgers is allowed at any time to such suppliers or parties. UPS will\ncancel any contracts, agreements, or purchase orders inadvertently issued, and will return unprocessed\nany invoices submitted for payment.', page_no=6, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2d24a63a-05c1-409e-ae74-6ff765f9998a'), chunk_index=37, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162288, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='If any current suppliers appear on the denied parties/debarred list, the following steps will be taken by\nUPS:\n1) Deactivation of the supplier in RU Marketplace/ Oracle.\n2) Notification to University Ethics and Compliance.\n3) Location of any open transactions with the supplier and notification to the unit responsible for\nthe transaction.\n4) Closure of any open transactions subject to the terms of any existing contracts.', page_no=6, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('367ccf6d-c1b0-4999-9182-e29ba45ef86c'), chunk_index=38, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162383, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='© 2025\nRutgers University Procurement Services\nPage 7 of 8\nCAUTION:  A printed copy of this document is uncontrolled and may not be the current version. Access current version on the UPS website.\n2.5 Federal Contracting and the Small Business Contracting Plan (SBSP)\nAs a recipient of federal funds for sponsored research, the University is required by Federal Acquisition', page_no=7, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d3ce936d-041e-49dd-8576-b0207036d055'), chunk_index=39, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162387, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Regulation (FAR 52.219-9) to prepare a Small Business Subcontracting Plan (SBSP) for each contract with\nan awarded value in excess of $700,000.  Under these plans, prime contractors and subcontractors, such\nas Rutgers, must agree to purchase a percentage of goods and services from certified Small Business\nConcerns.  Some federal agencies set specific percentage goals.\nThe SBSP is developed jointly by the principal investigator, the unit, and the Supplier Management Unit', page_no=7, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('21d8e875-60f3-4971-8686-877fb954c1a8'), chunk_index=40, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162391, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='within University Procurement Services. The SBSP specifies which items will be purchased from small\nbusiness concerns, the total dollars to be spent with each small business concern, and the percentage of\ndollars budgeted for supplies and services that the purchases represent.  Once the award has been\nmade, the SBSP becomes part of the contract and the principal investigator is expected to meet the\ngoals set in the plan.', page_no=7, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b7fbe576-f12c-4483-960a-9a986ceea421'), chunk_index=41, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162395, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='As a federal contractor, the University is required to prepare semi-annual reports to the federal\ngovernment of its purchases from Small Business Concerns for each contract.  The University identifies\nSmall Business Concerns and include them in the performance of these subcontract plans.\n2.6 Sustainability\nRutgers is committed to environmental stewardship by promoting the use of environmentally and\nsocially responsible products, whenever possible.  From a supplier management standpoint, UPS', page_no=7, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('59987a6d-d88d-49cf-a8d3-6cebcc48e5db'), chunk_index=42, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162399, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='collaborates with the University’s existing supplier base to identify and highlight for the campus, their\nportfolio of environmentally friendly products and services.\nFor federal awards, UPS:\n•\nGuides units to purchase only items that are in compliance with Environmental Protection\nAgency (EPA) at 40 CFR part 247 guidelines;\nFor all awards, including federal awards, UPS:\n•\nGuides units to purchase recycled and environmentally preferable products and services, when\npractical;\n•', page_no=7, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('72eb83a8-27e8-410b-963f-6c3a5bc3a71a'), chunk_index=43, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162403, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Meets with the campus units to discuss and explore opportunities to utilize products and\nservices with the greatest amount of recycled, recyclable, and post-consumer content;\n•\nCollaborates with existing suppliers to identify and highlight for the campus their portfolio of\nenvironmentally friendly products and services;\n•\nIdentifies green and environmentally responsible products made available by our suppliers and\npilots them within the University to validate compatibility and practicality; and', page_no=7, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('724d8b15-41f9-453b-9b10-20306e534588'), chunk_index=44, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162469, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='© 2025\nRutgers University Procurement Services\nPage 8 of 8\nCAUTION:  A printed copy of this document is uncontrolled and may not be the current version. Access current version on the UPS website.\n•\nGuides units to participate in the fleet management program that complies with the U.S.\nDepartment of Energy’s Alternative Fuel Transportation Program (See Sourcing 3.0).\n2.7 Supplier Management Post Contract Award and Dispute Resolution', page_no=8, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('866449cc-b203-4b4c-b5a0-46c6ce86d10b'), chunk_index=45, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162474, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='UPS monitors selected major contracts to ensure compliance to all pricing, terms and conditions.  In\naddition, UPS works with these suppliers to continually develop ways to drive costs down and improve\nservices for the Rutgers community.  The approach is dependent on the contract but may include:\n•\nReports from the supplier regarding key performance indicators (i.e. pricing, delivery data,\nproduct return data, etc.)\n•', page_no=8, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('20964886-03c3-4dda-b96a-739a8b9bc4f3'), chunk_index=46, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162478, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Regularly scheduled meetings with the supplier (i.e. quarterly business reviews)\nUPS also works with units on resolving any supplier conflicts that may arise, if requested.  Units are\nencouraged to contact the appropriate Category Manager for assistance in resolving any such issue.\nReferences\nPaymentWorks\nSupplier Onboarding System\nCampus Instructions  (via Canvas)\nSupplier Maintenance Request Process Instructions\nProcess Flowchart  (via Canvas)\nSupplier Management Process\nRevisions\nEffective Date\nApprover\nChange Reference\nIssue #', page_no=8, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('19d99502-e2e1-4b77-a416-1ceced14e66f'), chunk_index=47, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('08012a86-b4aa-481d-8427-189ab8575c45'), document_group_id=UUID('0b4fa83f-b55e-4a6e-9d16-2a578f4fe6c2'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 57, 58, 162481, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='11/2025\nM. Gower\n4', page_no=8, section=None, title=None)]
