2026-08-29 00:29:57 | INFO     | p2p_knowledge_hub.chunking.recursive_chunker:chunk:54 | Following chunks were produced. [DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('5350bd54-a8c9-4f04-8c39-c77fee9ecacd'), chunk_index=1, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855586, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='© 2025\nRutgers University Procurement Services\nPage 1 of 6\nCAUTION:  A printed copy of this document is uncontrolled and may not be the current version. Access current version on the UPS website.\nSTANDARD OPERATING PROCEDURE:\n5.0 ORDERING GOODS AND SERVICES\nThis procedure is in accordance with Procurement and Payment Policy 20.1.11.\nIntroduction\nOnce procurement authority (See 3.0 Sourcing) has been established, there are a number of options for', page_no=1, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('530035a2-8f1e-4054-9bce-448ca711d7bc'), chunk_index=2, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855602, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='placing orders for goods and services.  The best option for placing an order is dependent on the type of\ntransaction the unit requires.  These methods will be explained in the sections below.\nFor training and additional resources on Ordering Goods and Services, visit UPS’ Training and Resources.\nProcedure Outline\n5.1\nDetermining the Best Method for Placing an Order for Goods or Services', page_no=1, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0fb7adc2-8ce5-473e-a472-b5b168ae60bb'), chunk_index=3, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855608, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='5.2    Required Forms to Be Submitted with Each Order Request\n5.3    Change Orders\n5.4      Blanket Purchase Orders and Multi-Year Purchase Orders\n5.5\nPurchasing Card\nDefinitions\nBlanket Order: A blanket order is a purchase order the unit makes with its supplier which contains multiple\ndelivery dates over a period of time, often negotiated to take advantage of predetermined pricing. It is', page_no=1, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ccad50d8-32d7-4688-803f-4ac80d98890d'), chunk_index=4, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855612, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='normally used when there is a recurring need for expendable goods.\nBusiness Associate Agreement (BAA): This agreement is required when a unit is engaging services that\nincludes: creating, receiving, maintaining, or transmitting Protected Health Information (PHI).\nCheck Request:  An RU Marketplace form to request payment for certain expenses that do not require\nthe involvement of UPS or the issuance of a purchase order (see the check request matrix).', page_no=1, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('049ff0c5-b3af-4c71-b78f-4812706c427b'), chunk_index=5, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855616, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Accessibility Purchasing Form –This form is to be used to provide the necessary information needed for\nan accessibility review. All electronic information technology (EIT) systems, applications, software, and\nservices used by Rutgers University are required to be assessed for accessibility based on the Rutgers\nUniversity Accessibility Policy, current adopted version of WCAG, and applicable state and federal laws.', page_no=1, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b90d3ee9-d69c-4a8a-a812-5df4342f17e4'), chunk_index=6, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855620, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Facilities Approval: Any purchase needs to be reviewed and approved in writing by the facilities manager\nif a unit is considering the purchase of new equipment requiring utilities, modification to an existing space,\nor if a hole will be dug or material change to the landscape is required.  The approved document must get\nattached to the requisition.', page_no=1, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e73258ae-5799-4151-9d55-326a6fe34e1d'), chunk_index=7, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855625, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Goods Request Form: An RU Marketplace form used to issue quantity-based purchase orders for\ntangible goods that are $50,000 and over or for such requests, regardless of amount, not allowed to be\nissued on a Quick Order.', page_no=1, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('69c6c9b1-b1c0-403b-ac8e-e345b99c2d1d'), chunk_index=8, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855729, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='© 2025\nRutgers University Procurement Services\nPage 2 of 6\nCAUTION:  A printed copy of this document is uncontrolled and may not be the current version. Access current version on the UPS website.\nIndependent Contractor or Employee Determination (ICED): This is a prerequisite document for guest\nlecturer, honorarium, or professional services engagements, that the prospective supplier must complete', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('39308109-79d3-45c8-ac76-3b156ad60213'), chunk_index=9, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855734, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='and must be reviewed and approved by UPS or University Tax Department prior to a procurement contract\nbeing entered into and any start of service.\nInternal Purchase Order (IPO): A purchase order issued to order goods and services from other university\nservice units, such as dining services or facilities related services.\nMulti-Year Purchase Order: A purchase order issued to order services over the course of multiple years', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('378b7dd9-eaf6-4bbe-afa7-392c274f7114'), chunk_index=10, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855738, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Non-PO Upload: The non-PO upload process is a transaction process used for paying individuals rather\nthan businesses.  Payment is in the form of a check.\nProcurement Authority: Procurement authority is the confirmation/validation that the procurement of\ngoods or services conforms to the standards identified in the University’s Procurement and Payment\nPolicy 20.1.11.\nPublic Works Registration – This registration is needed for all facilities or constructions-based\nengagements ($2,000 or greater).', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('adf1abf1-9481-4564-86d3-f343cb0a77ab'), chunk_index=11, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855742, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Punchout catalog supplier: A contracted supplier that is electronically connected to RU Marketplace\nallowing the supplier to receive electronic copies of purchase orders as well as send electronic invoices to\nAccounts Payable.\nPunchout Order – An order that is electronically submitted in RU Marketplace via the online catalog tiles\nin RU Marketplace.\nPurchase Order: Is a legal document containing a description of the good or service requested, and terms', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8cb258f2-7cd9-4f16-aeab-bebf926945b4'), chunk_index=12, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855746, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='and conditions of the transaction including, but not limited to, payment and delivery terms, for the\npurchase or lease of goods and services.\nPurchasing Card (PCard): A university-issued credit card, to be used for purchases that are of low value\nand for goods and services.\nQuick Order:  A type of purchase order for goods under $50,000 that are not among the Restricted Items.', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e8f9229b-0858-4a55-8a1b-d19318be47e2'), chunk_index=13, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855749, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='A Quick Order does not require the review of UPS and will be sent directly to the supplier once the unit\napprovals are complete.\nService Request Form: Is an RU Marketplace form used to issue service-based purchase orders. Such\nrequests, regardless of amount, are not allowed to be issued on a Quick Order.\nStandard Operational Procedure (SOP): A set of instructions that functionally describes the key\nprocedures.', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ae7a5083-c635-4fc2-b388-ddee336ed7b0'), chunk_index=14, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855845, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='© 2025\nRutgers University Procurement Services\nPage 3 of 6\nCAUTION:  A printed copy of this document is uncontrolled and may not be the current version. Access current version on the UPS website.\nStatement of Work (SOW): All service-based purchase requisitions should have a Rutgers Statement of\nWork attached. This SOW outlines the scope of services and all deliverables associated with the', page_no=3, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0f14b090-ecf5-46a8-95f6-f4203b3a30d1'), chunk_index=15, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855850, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='engagement. The SOW instructions will assist in completing the form.\nThird Party Vendor Risk Assessment Form: This form assists units in evaluating the security/compliance\nof third parties or application service providers by requiring the supplier to disclose their method of\nmanaging and storing restricted, internal or public information. Rutgers’ Office of Information\nTechnology reviews the form and assesses the prospective supplier’s processes, making a', page_no=3, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1c5779f6-4b07-431e-b497-3034b55d3633'), chunk_index=16, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855853, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='recommendation regarding moving forward with the supplier.  The goal is to provide a safe environment\nfor Rutgers’ data, assets, resources, and confidentiality.  This is a prerequisite examination which must\nbe completed prior to a procurement contract being entered into by Rutgers.\nProcedures\n5.1 Determining the Best Method for Placing an Order for Goods or Services', page_no=3, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d7325eb1-d7d3-40af-a308-8bca902ba103'), chunk_index=17, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855857, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='It is a university requirement that a purchase order be issued prior to a supplier providing goods or\nservices.\nThere are several methods for end users to obtain goods and service.  The general order of preference is\nas follows:\n1. Internal Purchase Order (IPO)\n2. Punchout Order (PO)\n3. Contracted Supplier\na. Quick Order\nb. Goods Request Form\nc. Service Request Form\nd. Check Request\n5.2', page_no=3, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c068cb22-eaa6-4b65-bf84-18c3cc29df15'), chunk_index=18, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855861, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Required Forms to Be Submitted with Each Order Request\nEach order request (Quick Order, Goods, Service, Check) is required to have attached, as back up\ndocumentation, a quote, proposal or estimate, etc.  The back-up documentation should clearly state the\nsupplier’s name and contact information.  Depending on the supplier or the type of engagement,\nadditional form(s) or approvals may be required and must be attached to the purchase requisition.', page_no=3, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1b477c14-c1e6-45db-957f-7e118e01352c'), chunk_index=19, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855865, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Instructions for completion and attachment of the form to the order request should be followed.\nThese additional forms include:\n•\nBusiness Associate Agreement (BAA)\n•\nFacilities Approval', page_no=3, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('50525cca-09e7-48ff-8ad3-f5f10b1bbacc'), chunk_index=20, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855938, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='© 2025\nRutgers University Procurement Services\nPage 4 of 6\nCAUTION:  A printed copy of this document is uncontrolled and may not be the current version. Access current version on the UPS website.\n•\nIndependent Contractor or Employee Determination (ICED)\n•\nPublic Works Contractor Registration\n•\nStatement of Work\n•\nThird Party Vendor Risk Assessment (TPRA)\n•\nAccessibility Purchasing Form\n5.3         Change Orders', page_no=4, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c68b97ba-1bff-4f9a-bd4a-8832caaa02fa'), chunk_index=21, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855942, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='There are times when a unit needs to make a change to an existing purchase order. Reasons for\nchanging an existing purchase order include:\n•\nIncrease/decrease the amount of a blanket order\n•\nIncrease/decrease quantity of an item\n•\nChange in the scope of work impacting the cost of the order\n•\nCanceling an order\n•\nClosing an order (if remaining funds are on order)', page_no=4, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f7fc27d5-548e-4b44-9435-3811c1a155cf'), chunk_index=22, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855947, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Change orders cannot be issued for all types of purchase orders.  Change orders can be issued\nagainst the following:\n•\nInternal Purchase Order (IPO)\n•\nGoods Request\n•\nService Request\nChange orders cannot be issued against the following:\n•\nCheck Requests\n•\nQuick Orders\n•\nPunchout Catalog Orders\n5.4\nBlanket Purchase Orders and Multi-Year Purchase Orders\nBlanket Orders', page_no=4, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ac05b6cd-fb8b-47c4-95a7-e22f1821148a'), chunk_index=23, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855951, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='A blanket order is a purchase order the unit makes with its supplier which contains multiple\ndelivery dates over a period of time, often negotiated to take advantage of predetermined pricing.\nIt is normally used when there is a recurring need for expendable goods.  Blanket orders must not\nstay open for longer than 24 months. Exceptions must be approved by University Procurement', page_no=4, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('58dfafdf-6054-4d69-9efa-221c1df07b7b'), chunk_index=24, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 855959, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Services.  It is also highly encouraged to limit blanket orders for punchout suppliers.', page_no=4, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e51f4b27-cb9f-4e97-a7e7-d81c3ac96b8d'), chunk_index=25, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 856036, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='© 2025\nRutgers University Procurement Services\nPage 5 of 6\nCAUTION:  A printed copy of this document is uncontrolled and may not be the current version. Access current version on the UPS website.\nMulti-Year Orders\nA multi-year purchase order is a purchase order that is opened for year-to-year service.  Often,\nthe first year is funded and the remaining years are funded at the beginning of each year.', page_no=5, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4d78833a-6d8a-42a9-b971-4ed650402b17'), chunk_index=26, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 856040, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='However, any multi-year purchase orders that are associated with leases must be fully funded.  It\nis highly recommended that any other multi-year commitments be fully funded.\nAny project string or G/L string that is used to cover the first year of the agreement must be valid\nfor the entire first year term.  Subsequent years project string or G/L string may be changed prior', page_no=5, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('de018337-1a32-4906-bb5f-c4acaf36c20c'), chunk_index=27, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 856044, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='to the beginning of the next year(s) or the agreement.  Project strings or G/L string changes may\nonly happen once at the beginning of the next year term of the agreement.\n5.5         Purchasing Cards (PCards)\nThe Purchasing Card (Pcard) credit card program delegates purchasing authority and capability to\neligible Rutgers staff. The Pcard, eliminates the need for low-dollar requisitions and is convenient', page_no=5, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9a0a7d48-b54c-485b-8639-7f49097ec999'), chunk_index=28, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 856048, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='for suppliers that do not accept POs. Using the Pcard provides quicker turnaround time, greater\nflexibility, and reduced paperwork on orders.  The card may be used solely for purchases related\nto official Rutgers business.\nLow-dollar items may be purchased with the PCard if the following two conditions are met:\n•\nthe item is not available from a university-contacted supplier or an internal supplier; and\n•', page_no=5, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('5a901094-8826-4990-a829-c92140a6076c'), chunk_index=29, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 856051, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='the purchase is necessary to the mission of the unit\nReferences\nCampus Instructions\nActive IPO Search\nCheck Request Processing Instructions\nSubmit a Check Request\nPunchout Process Instructions\nSubmit a Quick Order\nSubmit a Goods Request\nSubmit a Service Request\nProcess Flowchart\nOrdering Goods and Services', page_no=5, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7bc1f94e-667c-45d1-ba03-959fbd625450'), chunk_index=30, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('24beee6d-87a6-436a-af15-a2ee6e4ca304'), document_group_id=UUID('59695215-98aa-4484-901d-538b0b819b6e'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 28, 18, 59, 57, 856058, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='© 2025 \nRutgers University Procurement Services \nPage 6 of 6 \nCAUTION:  A printed copy of this document is uncontrolled and may not be the current version. Access current version on the UPS website. \n \n \nRevisions \n \nEffective Date \nApprover \nChange Reference \nIssue # \n06/2023 \nM. Gower \n \n3', page_no=6, section=None, title=None)]
