2026-08-29 00:32:29 | INFO     | p2p_knowledge_hub.generation.ollama:generate:49 | [GenerationContext(chunk_id=UUID('ada2b9d0-f395-4658-911e-9318de7b6cc0'), text='Wire: A payment method for electronically transferring funds from Rutgers to another entity through Treasury. At\nRutgers, these are used for international payments only and domestic payments as an exception.\n8.1\nMethods of Payment\nRutgers offers several methods of payment for suppliers. Payment is issued when all requirements are\nmet for processing an invoice, including making any order modifications, resolving invoice disputes or', document_name='Chapter 8 University Procurement Services Procedures Manual.pdf', page_no=2, section=None, title=None, source_uri='/home/san/Projects/P2P_Knowledge_Hub/data/raw/Chapter 8 University Procurement Services Procedures Manual.pdf'), GenerationContext(chunk_id=UUID('ddbea4a2-39fb-4a01-a1f1-0be6800cbe36'), text="payment method with the smallest rank of all payment methods defined for that remittance location. This\ncapability only works if the payment method is ACH or Wire.\n•\nThe SAP Ariba solution uses the following additional fields to look up right Remit To address: ABA Routing\nnumber, Swift ID, iBanID, Account ID.\n•\nFor IR documents, if there's no matching remittance location in the SAP Ariba solution, the remittance location", document_name='InvPayProcess.pdf', page_no=73, section=None, title=None, source_uri='/home/san/Projects/P2P_Knowledge_Hub/data/raw/InvPayProcess.pdf'), GenerationContext(chunk_id=UUID('2dffeac0-9a56-47ae-9ca7-eb72e81a53dd'), text='for payments to be disbursed in a timely manner.  Payment issues can be resolved by contacting Univerity\nProcurement Services Help Desk.\nFor training and additional resources on Payments, please visit UPS’ Training and Resources.\nProcedure Outline\n8.1    Methods of Payment\n8.2   Non-Purchase Order (PO) Upload Requests\n8.3   Change in Payment Terms\n8.4   Miscellaneous Transactions\n8.5    Utilities\n8.6    Direct to Oracle Feeds\n8.7    Taxes\nDefinitions', document_name='Chapter 8 University Procurement Services Procedures Manual.pdf', page_no=1, section=None, title=None, source_uri='/home/san/Projects/P2P_Knowledge_Hub/data/raw/Chapter 8 University Procurement Services Procedures Manual.pdf')]
